{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"w":0.34456189473470045,"y":0.040640427300704607,"h":0.0193060742219755,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","c":1,"x":0.6142952409914002},{"x":0.059793812101379587,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 2","h":0.020348836167448092,"w":0.38144330342610683,"c":1,"y":0.090116279585134795},{"y":0.12500000011209134,"w":0.21649485270182292,"c":1,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","h":0.017441859892096456,"x":0.059793809381047301},{"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7 score. Here is the","y":0.16559013518357968,"w":0.83505152384440107,"c":1,"x":0.059793825590614059,"h":0.017615971814445075},{"t":"examiner's comment:","x":0.059793810691530641,"w":0.21649485270182292,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.18459302318220372,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.22078684669963133,"t":"All parts of the prompt are addressed and a clear position is presented throughout","x":0.10721648240294807,"w":0.82680414835611971,"h":0.01614797416324143},{"w":0.74226806640624998,"c":1,"x":0.10721648215594248,"y":0.2398255815623791,"t":"the response. Main ideas are extended and supported. Ideas are logically","h":0.015988371754420694},{"t":"organised and there is a clear progression throughout the response. A range of","x":0.10927834545153388,"y":0.25719318826678761,"w":0.79381444295247405,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1},{"w":0.80219970703124999,"y":0.27542755197382118,"h":0.019020610323249088,"t":"cohesive devices is used flexibly, while each paragraph has a clear central topic","x":0.1092050766196697,"c":1},{"w":0.81030929565429677,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"y":0.29505813970154671,"t":"which is developed. The lexical resource is sufficient to allow some flexibility and","x":0.10721648608085056},{"y":0.31215248648568217,"h":0.020073376049102309,"c":1,"w":0.83928599039713558,"t":"precision and although there are a few spelling errors, these do not detract from the","x":0.10716324874846266},{"t":"overall clarity of the response. A variety of complex structures is used with some","x":0.10721650660215649,"y":0.32994186011988469,"c":1,"h":0.018895349149765539,"w":0.80412368774414056},{"c":1,"t":"flexibility and accuracy. Grammar and punctuation are well controlled and error-free","x":0.10515463671422576,"y":0.35026423979626009,"w":0.83917526245117191,"h":0.017468318614410894},{"t":"sentences are frequent.","x":0.10496066530176772,"h":0.017817000536378247,"c":1,"w":0.23957661946614583,"y":0.36786994104289128},{"h":0.020551967116852587,"w":0.84742268880208338,"t":"Many may say, and I agree, that today's society has almost erased all its boarders","y":0.40546095109612623,"c":1,"x":0.057731954344492638},{"x":0.057731966315989591,"w":0.85154637654622389,"c":1,"y":0.42587209330146003,"h":0.017463197444931411,"t":"and soon will become limitless in what concerns travelling for both work and pleasure."},{"t":"Therefore, if this is to happen, then leaming a new langunge is necessary.","h":0.02074296517856522,"c":1,"x":0.05553037357801751,"y":0.44304418116497446,"w":0.75284352620442707},{"y":0.47093023239718446,"x":0.057731937220868494,"w":0.86804128011067716,"h":0.018895349149765428,"t":"Nawadhys, learning a new bangunge for the purpose of working in other countries seems","c":1},{"h":0.025118477821910012,"w":0.86840321858723968,"y":0.48445462746382995,"x":0.055467902709689647,"t":"to becorse more and more paputor. Adutts in need of money or, why not, recognision are","c":1},{"w":0.87010304768880198,"x":0.055670125592478997,"c":1,"h":0.01889534914976565,"y":0.50726744169973048,"t":"trying to pursue their háppiness for away from home. Also, the hey days of emplajers"},{"t":"looking only for capable peopte have gone. It seems thak today's emplajers are looking","y":0.52466236039669589,"h":0.02039577844768703,"x":0.055670125741415576,"c":1,"w":0.85567006429036441},{"y":0.54492072839817374,"h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.8948453776041666,"x":0.055670094597439289,"c":1,"t":"not only for mutti-skilled emplagees, but they also want people who know more than their"},{"w":0.84329895019531242,"y":0.56395348853912963,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"t":"mother tongue. Sooner or later, those who omitted learning more are prone to become","x":0.057731968088874527},{"t":"jobtess.","x":0.048910278904787982,"c":1,"w":0.079061126708984367,"y":0.58203839702662341,"h":0.015885645966633444},{"h":0.019083969465648831,"t":"However, to my mind, a new langunge shouldh't be learned just for travelling or working in","y":0.60745742844865158,"c":1,"x":0.055670101518603965,"w":0.89278350830078124},{"x":0.055670121869009485,"c":1,"y":0.62645348821355462,"w":0.88659790039062503,"h":0.01889534914976565,"t":"a foreign cauntry. A foreign language should help the leamer broaden his mind. By this I"},{"y":0.64511429430058187,"h":0.019619897471689351,"c":1,"x":0.053573029123484633,"w":0.88669321695963554,"t":"mear that the rew langunge should and will alloww us to understand more ahout the wond"},{"t":"itself, and maybe our ancestorsẾays of thinking and acting. Needless to say, knowing","x":0.053430445853911317,"y":0.65905604089233694,"w":0.88700836181640619,"c":1,"h":0.026859236407546061},{"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1,"x":0.057731971218672226,"y":0.68313953505043501,"w":0.85773193359375011,"t":"another language will help us when it comes to understanding the human race, because"},{"h":0.020275998521537164,"w":0.41049491882324218,"x":0.055561034896730345,"y":0.69949842985831612,"c":1,"t":"language is the first poem of a country."},{"w":0.85567006429036463,"c":1,"y":0.72665883679519616,"x":0.057731977998583851,"t":"All of this being said, I believe that learning a different language should be not onky","h":0.019083969465648831},{"h":0.020478562754319141,"y":0.74527238800607964,"c":1,"w":0.84759404500325519,"t":"for satisfying our physical needs, like money, but also aur moral needs, because never","x":0.057616002155381235},{"h":0.023301047853211077,"y":0.76012918365888649,"t":"before had such a big thirst for knawledge been di splayed.","x":0.055670110294210338,"c":1,"w":0.58350514729817715},{"h":0.024146245216105311,"c":1,"y":0.95282647510801555,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.29363896687825525,"x":0.35215498327559697},{"c":1,"y":0.94767441859067625,"x":0.90721649516836811,"w":0.041237112681070887,"t":"137","h":0.01453488361674482}]}